<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  TEMPLATE — NOT AN INSTALLED AGENT. Supersedes
  ops/launchd-proposed/com.thanapol.ai-capital.watchdog.plist.

  Independent liveness observer. Records machine-opportunity evidence to the
  canonical heartbeat file, then assesses the daily run state. Sends no external
  notification — awareness is pull-only.

  RunAtLoad SEMANTICS. RunAtLoad=true makes launchd execute the SCRIPT
  immediately on load. It does NOT mean a pipeline is submitted:
  pipeline-watchdog.sh decides eligibility from recorded state every time, and an
  ineligible opportunity exits 0 having submitted nothing.

  NO DATABASE CREDENTIAL, DELIBERATELY. The superseded file carried one. The
  watchdog only reads the SQLite run ledger and the heartbeat file; it never
  connects to PostgreSQL. An observer does not need write authority over the
  thing it observes.

  Loading the installed copy is a PRODUCTION-STATE ACTION and requires separate
  authorization.

  RENDERING (the renderer now exists, and it handles no secret).
  This file is a SOURCE ARTIFACT. It is rendered by
  packages/queue/bin/render-launchd-plist.ts, which for this agent substitutes
  only a repository path and an unauthenticated Redis endpoint — this job
  receives NO PostgreSQL credential and NO credential-file path at all. The
  renderer escapes XML, writes through a private same-directory temporary,
  fsyncs, lints, parses its own output to confirm no environment entry holds a
  PostgreSQL URL, publishes with link(2), and fsyncs the directory.

    pnpm --filter @common/queue render-plist -- --agent <name> --root <abs> …

  The earlier `sed` instructions were removed rather than fixed: passing a value
  through command arguments exposes it in the process table, and `sed`
  mishandles `&`, `|`, backslashes and `& < >`.

  NOTHING HAS BEEN PROVISIONED OR INSTALLED. No plist is installed and no agent
  has been started or restarted.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>Label</key>
	<string>com.thanapol.ai-capital.watchdog</string>

	<key>ProgramArguments</key>
	<array>
		<string>/bin/bash</string>
		<string>@@AI_CAPITAL_ROOT@@/scripts/pipeline-watchdog.sh</string>
	</array>

	<key>WorkingDirectory</key>
	<string>@@AI_CAPITAL_ROOT@@</string>

	<key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
	<dict>
		<key>PATH</key>
		<string>/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin</string>
		<key>AI_CAPITAL_ROOT</key>
		<string>@@AI_CAPITAL_ROOT@@</string>
		<key>PIPELINE_RUNS_DB</key>
		<string>@@AI_CAPITAL_ROOT@@/data/pipeline-runs.db</string>
		<key>SCHEDULER_HEARTBEAT_FILE</key>
		<string>@@AI_CAPITAL_ROOT@@/data/scheduler-heartbeat.log</string>
		<key>DATA_ROOT</key>
		<string>@@AI_CAPITAL_ROOT@@/apps</string>
		<key>REDIS_URL</key>
		<string>@@REDIS_URL@@</string>
	</dict>

	<key>RunAtLoad</key>
	<true/>
	<key>StartInterval</key>
	<integer>1800</integer>

	<key>StandardOutPath</key>
	<string>@@AI_CAPITAL_ROOT@@/logs/pipeline-watchdog.log</string>
	<key>StandardErrorPath</key>
	<string>@@AI_CAPITAL_ROOT@@/logs/pipeline-watchdog.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
